{"id":190,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"This treetop dweller possesses a tail as dexterous as a hand. Ancient writings describe this Pokémon as a one-armed oddity."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It searches for prey from the tops of trees. When it spots its favorite food, Bounsweet, Aipom gets excited and pounces."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"As it did more and more with its tail, its hands became clumsy. It makes its nest high in the treetops."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Aipom’s tail ends in a hand-like appendage that can be cleverly manipulated. However, because the Pokémon uses its tail so much, its real hands have become rather clumsy."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Its tail is so powerful that it can use it to grab a tree branch and hold itself up in the air."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It lives atop tall trees. When leaping from branch to branch, it deftly uses its tail for balance."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It lives high among the treetops. It can use its tail as freely and cleverly as its hands."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It lives atop giant trees. It wraps its tail around a branch so it won’t fall off while asleep."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It uses its tail to pluck fruits that are out of reach. Its tail is more adept than its real hands."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its tail ends with a dexterous, handlike appendage. However, because it uses the tail so much, AIPOM’s real hands have become rather clumsy."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It uses its tail to hang on to tree branches. It uses its momentum to swing from one branch to another."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Run Away","hidden":false,"description":"Enables a sure getaway from wild Pokémon."},{"name":"Pickup","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may pick up an item another Pokémon used during a battle. It may pick up items outside of battle, too."},{"name":"Skill Link","hidden":true,"description":"Maximizes the number of times multistrike moves hit."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"forest","color":"Purple","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":190,"name":"Aipom","condition":null,"children":[{"id":424,"name":"Ambipom","condition":"Level up, knowing Double Hit","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,39],[4,28],[8,310],[11,226],[15,321],[18,154],[22,129],[25,103],[29,97],[32,458],[36,374],[39,417],[43,387]],"machine":[512,332,97,226,280,886,91,38,283,203,263,7,374,264,492,447,441,270,8,282,67,490,118,341,189,417,182,240,156,402,247,421,214,479,76,180,164,241,129,36,269,851,168,675,87,9,86,85,885,369,918,352],"egg":[251,340,68,343,252,231,501,21,415],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv4-211","name":"Aipom","set":"Paradox Rift","date":"2023-11-03","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"211","artist":"Yuka Morii","img":"sv4/211"},{"id":"me2-78","name":"Aipom","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Common","number":"78","artist":"Saboteri","img":"me2/78"},{"id":"sv6-137","name":"Aipom","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"137","artist":"Mugi Hamada","img":"sv6/137"},{"id":"sv4-145","name":"Aipom","set":"Paradox Rift","date":"2023-11-03","rarity":"Common","number":"145","artist":"aspara","img":"sv4/145"},{"id":"swsh11-144","name":"Aipom","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Common","number":"144","artist":"Kouki Saitou","img":"swsh11/144"},{"id":"pgo-56","name":"Aipom","set":"Pokémon GO","date":"2022-07-01","rarity":"Common","number":"56","artist":"Sanosuke Sakuma","img":"pgo/56"},{"id":"sm12-169","name":"Aipom","set":"Cosmic Eclipse","date":"2019-11-01","rarity":"Common","number":"169","artist":"Miki Tanaka","img":"sm12/169"},{"id":"smp-SM244","name":"Aipom","set":"SM Black Star Promos","date":"2017-02-03","rarity":"Promo","number":"SM